      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "respectively, where the unsubscripted F is the ratio of observed mean squares defined by Equation 18.18, and the F values subscripted by their degrees of freedom are the critical values associated with $ \\alpha/2 $. These values are also obtainable from standard tables.",
